<title>USA: FINAL PRICING -- State of Ohio.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING -- State of Ohio.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF OHIO</p>
<p>RE: $35,000,000</p>
<p>Education Loan Revenue Bonds, Series 1997A</p>
<p>(Supplemental Student Loan Program)</p>
<p>Series 1997A-1 (Fixed Rate Bonds)</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE FINAL AMOUNTS.</p>
<p>WRITTEN AWARD.</p>
<p>			     SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 06/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON</p>
<p>12/01/2009		5,150M    5.40  %</p>
<p>12/01/2010		4,200M    5.50  %</p>
<p>12/01/2011		2,800M    5.55  %</p>
<p>12/01/2019	     22,850M    5.85  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 06/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 06/01/2009</p>
<p>FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION REGARDING EXTRAORDINARY REDEMPTION</p>
<p>PROVISIONS PLEASE REFER TO PRELIMINARY OFFICIAL STATEMENT.</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award was received on Friday, June 6, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is firm for June 10, 1997.</p>
<p>The bonds will be blue skyed in all states.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
